## Checklist: Before Going Live

### Security
- [ ] RLS enabled on all tables
- [ ] Service role key only on server
- [ ] Auth redirect URLs configured
- [ ] Rate limiting on API routes

### Database
- [ ] All migrations applied to production
- [ ] Indexes added for common queries
- [ ] Backups enabled (automatic on Supabase)

### App
- [ ] Environment variables set in Vercel
- [ ] Error tracking configured
- [ ] Analytics enabled
- [ ] Custom domain configured
- [ ] SSL certificate active (automatic)

### Testing
- [ ] Auth flows work (signup, login, logout)
- [ ] Data operations work (CRUD)
- [ ] File uploads work (if applicable)
- [ ] Email sending works (if applicable)


## Troubleshooting

### Build Fails on Vercel

```bash
# Check build locally first
npm run build

# Common issues:
# - TypeScript errors
# - Missing environment variables
# - Import errors
```

### Database Connection Issues

```bash
# Check Supabase status
# https://status.supabase.com

# Verify connection string
supabase status

# Check if migrations are in sync
supabase db diff
```

### Auth Not Working

1. Check Site URL in Supabase Dashboard
2. Verify redirect URLs include your domain
3. Check browser console for CORS errors
4. Verify environment variables are set


## Key Conventions

- **Never commit secrets** - Use environment variables
- **Migrate before deploy** - Database changes before app changes
- **Use preview deployments** - Test changes before production
- **Monitor after deploy** - Check logs and analytics
- **Keep environments in sync** - Same migrations in dev and prod
